          "name": "Basic Buffer (Henderson-Hasselbalch)",
          "latex": "\\text{pOH} = \\text{pK}_b + \\log\\left(\\frac{[\\text{Conjugate Acid}]}{[\\text{Weak Base}]}\\right)",
          "tags": [
