            "ab3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [
        "Dynamic Nature: Equilibrium is dynamic; forward and reverse reactions proceed at equal rates.",
        "Heterogeneous Equilibrium: Concentrations and partial pressures of pure solids and pure liquids are constant and omitted from $K_c$ and $K_p$ expressions.",
        "Le Chatelier’s Principle: Increasing pressure shifts equilibrium toward the side with fewer gaseous moles ($\\Delta n_g < 0$).",
        "Exothermic ($\\Delta H < 0$): Increasing T decreases K, shifting equilibrium in reverse. Endothermic ($\\Delta H > 0$): Increasing T increases K, shifting equilibrium forward.",
        "Catalyst: Increases forward and reverse reaction rates equally by lowering activation energy; does not affect K or equilibrium composition.",
        "Acid-Base Theories: Arrhenius yields $\\text{H}^+$ or $\\text{OH}^-$ in water. Brönsted-Lowry is proton donor/acceptor. Lewis is electron-pair acceptor/donor.",
        "Common Ion Effect: The suppression of degree of dissociation ($\\alpha$) of a weak electrolyte by adding a strong electrolyte containing a common ion.",
        "Precipitation occurs if Ionic Product $Q_{sp} > K_{sp}$; solution is saturated if $Q_{sp} = K_{sp}$; unsaturated if $Q_{sp} < K_{sp}$."
      ],
      "keyDerivations": [
        "Derivation of Relation between $K_p$ and $K_c$: $K_p = K_c(RT)^{\\Delta n}$",
        "Weak Acid Ionization: $K_a = \\frac{c\\alpha^2}{1-\\alpha} \\approx c\\alpha^2$ (for $\\alpha \\ll 1$)",
        "Conjugate Acid-Base Pair Relation: $K_a \\times K_b = K_w$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c_ch20",
      "class": "11",
      "name": "Classification of Elements and Periodicity in Properties",
      "formulas": [
        {
          "id": "c3_1",
          "name": "Effective Nuclear Charge",
          "latex": "Z_{\\text{eff}} = Z - \\sigma",
          "tags": [
            "nuclear charge",
            "shielding"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3_2",
          "name": "Pauling Electronegativity Difference",
          "latex": "\\chi_A - \\chi_B = 0.208\\sqrt{\\Delta\\text{ (kcal/mol)}} = 0.102\\sqrt{\\Delta\\text{ (kJ/mol)}}",
          "tags": [
            "electronegativity",
            "pauling"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3_3",
          "name": "Pauling Delta Energy",
          "latex": "\\Delta = E_{A-B} - \\sqrt{E_{A-A} \\cdot E_{B-B}}",
          "tags": [
            "bond energy"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c3_4",
          "name": "Mulliken Electronegativity",
          "latex": "\\chi_M = \\frac{\\text{IE} + \\text{EA}}{2}\\text{ (in eV)}, \\qquad \\chi_P \\approx \\frac{\\chi_M}{2.8}",
          "tags": [
            "electronegativity",
            "mulliken"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [],
      "keyDerivations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c_ch21",
      "class": "11",
      "name": "Chemical Bonding and Molecular Structure",
      "formulas": [
        {
          "id": "c4_1",
          "name": "Formal Charge",
          "latex": "\\text{FC} = V - L - \\frac{1}{2}B",
          "tags": [
            "formal charge",
            "bonding"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4_2",
          "name": "Dipole Moment",
          "latex": "\\mu = q \\times d",
          "tags": [
            "dipole moment",
            "bonding"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4_3",
          "name": "Resultant Dipole Moment",
          "latex": "\\mu_{\\text{net}} = \\sqrt{\\mu_1^2 + \\mu_2^2 + 2\\mu_1\\mu_2\\cos\\theta}",
          "tags": [
            "dipole moment",
            "resultant"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4_4",
          "name": "Ionic Character",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{ Ionic Character} = \\frac{\\mu_{\\text{observed}}}{\\mu_{\\text{calculated}}} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "ionic character"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4_5",
          "name": "Bond Order (MOT)",
          "latex": "\\text{Bond Order} = \\frac{N_b - N_a}{2}",
          "tags": [
            "bond order",
            "mot"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c4_6",
          "name": "Steric Number",
          "latex": "\\text{SN} = \\frac{1}{2}[V + M - C + A]",
          "tags": [
            "steric number",
            "hybridization"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [],
      "keyDerivations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c_ch22",
      "class": "11",
      "name": "Redox Reactions",
      "formulas": [
        {
          "id": "c7_1",
          "name": "Equivalent Weight",
          "latex": "E = \\frac{\\text{Molar Mass}}{n\\text{-factor}}",
          "tags": [
            "equivalent weight"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7_2",
          "name": "Number of Equivalents",
          "latex": "\\text{Number of Equivalents} = \\frac{\\text{Mass}}{E} = N \\times V\\text{ (L)}",
          "tags": [
            "equivalents"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7_3",
          "name": "Equivalence Law",
          "latex": "N_1 V_1 = N_2 V_2 \\implies n_1 M_1 V_1 = n_2 M_2 V_2",
          "tags": [
            "equivalence law"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7_4",
          "name": "Standard Cell Potential",
          "latex": "E_{\\text{cell}}^\\circ = E_{\\text{cathode}}^\\circ - E_{\\text{anode}}^\\circ",
          "tags": [
            "cell potential"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c7_5",
          "name": "Gibbs Energy & Cell Potential",
          "latex": "\\Delta G^\\circ = -nFE_{\\text{cell}}^\\circ",
          "tags": [
            "gibbs energy",
            "cell potential"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [],
      "keyDerivations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c_ch23",
      "class": "11",
      "name": "Organic Chemistry – Some Basic Principles and Techniques",
      "formulas": [
        {
          "id": "c8_1",
          "name": "Carbon Estimation (Liebig)",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{C} = \\frac{12}{44} \\times \\frac{m_{\\text{CO}_2}}{m} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "carbon",
            "estimation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_2",
          "name": "Hydrogen Estimation (Liebig)",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{H} = \\frac{2}{18} \\times \\frac{m_{\\text{H}_2\\text{O}}}{m} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "hydrogen",
            "estimation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_3",
          "name": "Nitrogen Estimation (Dumas)",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{N} = \\frac{28}{22400} \\times \\frac{V_0\\text{ (mL at STP)}}{m} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "nitrogen",
            "estimation",
            "dumas"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_4",
          "name": "Nitrogen Estimation (Kjeldahl)",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{N} = \\frac{1.4 \\times N \\times V}{m}",
          "tags": [
            "nitrogen",
            "estimation",
            "kjeldahl"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_5",
          "name": "Halogen Estimation (Carius)",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{X} = \\frac{\\text{Atomic Mass of X}}{\\text{Molar Mass of AgX}} \\times \\frac{m_{\\text{AgX}}}{m} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "halogen",
            "estimation",
            "carius"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_6",
          "name": "Sulfur Estimation (Carius)",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{S} = \\frac{32}{233} \\times \\frac{m_{\\text{BaSO}_4}}{m} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "sulfur",
            "estimation",
            "carius"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_7",
          "name": "Phosphorus Estimation",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{P} = \\frac{62}{222} \\times \\frac{m_{\\text{Mg}_2\\text{P}_2\\text{O}_7}}{m} \\times 100",
          "tags": [
            "phosphorus",
            "estimation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_8",
          "name": "Oxygen Estimation",
          "latex": "\\% \\text{O} = 100 - \\sum (\\% \\text{ of all other elements})",
          "tags": [
            "oxygen",
            "estimation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c8_9",
          "name": "Retardation Factor (Rf)",
          "latex": "R_f = \\frac{\\text{Distance moved by the substance from baseline}}{\\text{Distance moved by the solvent front from baseline}}",
          "tags": [
            "chromatography",
            "rf"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [],
      "keyDerivations": []
    },
    {
      "id": "c_ch24",
      "class": "11",
      "name": "Hydrocarbons",
      "formulas": [
        {
          "id": "c9_1",
          "name": "General Molecular Formulas",
          "latex": "\\text{Alkanes: } \\text{C}_n\\text{H}_{2n+2}, \\qquad \\text{Alkenes: } \\text{C}_n\\text{H}_{2n}, \\qquad \\text{Alkynes: } \\text{C}_n\\text{H}_{2n-2}",
          "tags": [
            "hydrocarbons",
            "formulas"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9_2",
          "name": "General Hydrocarbon Combustion",
          "latex": "\\text{C}_x\\text{H}_y + \\left(x + \\frac{y}{4}\\right)\\text{O}_2 \\to x\\text{CO}_2 + \\frac{y}{2}\\text{H}_2\\text{O}",
          "tags": [
            "combustion",
            "hydrocarbons"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9_3",
          "name": "Hückel’s Rule (Aromaticity)",
          "latex": "\\text{Aromatic Electrons} = (4n + 2)\\pi \\quad (n = 0, 1, 2, 3\\dots)",
          "tags": [
            "aromaticity",
            "huckel"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c9_4",
          "name": "Alkene Stability",
          "latex": "\\text{Stability} \\propto \\frac{1}{\\text{Heat of Hydrogenation}} \\propto \\text{Number of }\\alpha\\text{-Hydrogens}",
          "tags": [
            "alkene",
            "stability",
            "hyperconjugation"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "keyPoints": [],
      "keyDerivations": []
    }
  ]
